  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria - Bauchi Township Water Supply Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Nigeria - Projet d&apos;approvisionnement en eau de la ville de Bauchi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is intended to build a water treatement plant at Gubi Dam with a capacity of 45500 cubic meters/day (10MGD) and to distribute potable water to Bauchi town and its environs. Through this project, it will be possible to meet the domestic, industrial, commercial and institutional requirements up to the year 2000. Later, minor additions to the main components of the project would ensure that supply can be gauranteed up to the year 2006/7. The project will also strengthen the institution (BSUUB) and impove its operations through providing technical assistance, trainning of staff and acquiring operational facilities.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
